# Typed binding in case arm — 3-arg form: [case [let x] x body] binds x to scrutinee.
# @Int annotation in [let x@Int] is a static constraint; x is bound by the pattern.
[f: [fn [let n] [match n
  [case [let x] x [+ x 1]]
  [case [let _] _ 0]]]
 result: [f 5]]
=== out
Dict({"f": Function(n), "result": Int(6)})
